s associa=C3=A7=C3=B5es entre Tabelas Dimens=C3=A3o e Tabelas Fato dever=C3=
=A3o ser respectivamente 1:N.<br>4.4.2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Os verbos de=
 liga=C3=A7=C3=A3o devem ser definidos (Parent e Child Role).<br>4.4.3.&nbs=
p;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;A op=C3=A7=C3=A3o =E2=80=9CChange Parent Allowed=E2=80=
=9D n=C3=A3o =C3=A9 permitida.</p><div class=3D"anchor-h4"><h4 class=3D"hea=
dingSpacingAbove headingSpacingBelow lineHeight1_4" id=3D"4.5.-coluna"><spa=
